<http://www.example.com/cmo/skill/0488> a cmo:Skill ;
    cmo:inFramework <http://www.example.com/cmo/framework/ESCO> ;
    skos:definition """Inter-disciplinary programmes and qualifications to which the greatest intended learning time is devoted to business, administration and law are classified here.

=== Inclusions
Study of business and administration where emphasis is not given towards any of the detailed fields under 041 is included in this field.

=== Exclusions
Business programmes where emphasis is given to any of the detailed fields under 041 'Business and administration' (management, administration, marketing etc.) should be classified according to the specialisation."""@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "programmes interdisciplinaires et certifications impliquant le commerce, l'administration et le droit"@fr .

