    skos:definition """Travel and tourism is the study of marketing and advertising tourist destinations and events. It includes the study of ticketing and reservation practices. Leisure is the study of recreational and leisure activities for individuals and groups.
Programmes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:
Abseiling (rope climbing)
Adventure based activities
Ground crew training (airport)
Guiding, tour leading
Recreation and leisure
Tourist trades programmes
Travel agency services
Travel and tourism
Travel services

=== Inclusions
Basic training in how to treat tourists is included here.

=== Exclusions
Study of recreation and leisure activities for school children is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0922 'Child care and youth services'."""@fr ;
