    skos:definition """Writing original text of a creative nature for artistic, journalistic, promotional or similar purposes.
Examples:
- write storylines
- create script for artistic production
- write headlines
- perform copywriting

Excludes:
- revise translations
- write computer programmes / coding"""@fr ;
