    skos:definition """Monitoring the operations of a business or organisation to ensure adequate performance and compliance with regulatory requirements.
Excludes:
- Testing and analysing substances

Examples:
- Detect bottlenecks
- Monitor mine production
- Manage project metrics"""@fr ;
