    cmo:inFramework <http://www.example.com/cmo/framework/ESCO> ;
    skos:definition """Assembling, fabricating or repairing precision instruments, such as optical devices, clocks and musical instruments, by hand or using hand-held tools and equipment.
Excludes:
- Operation of automated assembly equipment
- Assembly of electrical and electronic products and components
- Fabrication of decorative objects 
- Fabrication of medical, orthotic and prosthetic devices

Examples:
- Assemble jewellery parts
- Attach pendulums
- Customise guns
- Repair musical instruments
- Centre lenses"""@fr ;
