    skos:definition """Treating injuries and health conditions among humans, through administering medication and providing other medical treatments and nursing care.
Examples:
- provide professional care in nursing
- administer prescribed medication
- carry out wound care
- manage acute pain
- rehabilitate worn dentition

Excludes:
- veterinary care
- performing surgery
- physiotherapy
- occupational therapy
- psychotherapy"""@fr ;
