    cmo:inFramework <http://www.example.com/cmo/framework/ESCO> ;
    skos:definition """Ensuring compliance with operational procedures, standards or guidelines at company level related to matters other than health, safety and the environment.
Examples:
- adhere to organisational guidelines
- apply socially just working principles

Excludes:
- comply with legislation in social services
- ensure compliance with gaming laws
- follow hygienic practices in fishery operations"""@fr ;
