    skos:definition """Directing, supervising and coordinating operational activities, projects and tasks in an organisation.
Examples:
- coordinate rescue missions
- coordinate operational activities
- oversee pre-assembly operations

Excludes:
- coordinate dock operations
- forecast workload
- manage ICT project"""@fr ;
