    skos:definition """Operating machinery for the extraction and processing of rocks and minerals, or for drilling and boring wells and tunnels.
Excludes:
- Operating mobile earthmoving and transportation equipment
- Operating hand-held and bench drills

Examples:
- Drive tunnel boring machine
- Operate continuous miner
- Operate core drilling equipment
- Tend stone splitting machine"""@fr ;
