    skos:definition """Developing organisational and operational methods, policies, procedures or standards on company level to ensure streamlining of its operational processes.
Examples:
- define organisational standards
- establish an ICT customer support process

Excludes: 
- define geographic sales areas
- develop business case 
- develop environmental policy"""@fr ;
