    skos:definition """Explaining medical and healthcare information to patients or family members and/or advising them on medical, health or wellness issues.
Examples:
- advise on rehabilitation exercises
- advise on medical device features
- offer advice on diet related concerns
- explain the molecular basis of a disease to patients

Excludes:
- provide advice on animal health"""@fr ;
