    skos:definition """Working confidently within a group with each doing their part in the service of the whole. Understanding and respecting the roles and competencies of other team members.
Examples:
- work in multidisciplinary teams 
- work in assembly line teams
- collaborate with designers
- cooperate with colleagues
- work in a forestry team
- work in shifts

Excludes:
- management, supervision and coordination of teams"""@fr ;
